{
  "name": "Second Brain – Demo Reset",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🔄 Second Brain — Reset demo harian (opsional)\nHanya untuk deployment **demo** (`APP_MODE=demo`, mis. `https://demo-2ndbrain.ilramdhan.dev`). Vercel Cron di project demo sudah menjalankan reset yang sama setiap 00:00 WIB; workflow ini cadangan/alternatif. Menjalankan keduanya aman (reset idempoten).\n\nTiap hari 00:00 (zona workflow Asia/Jakarta) → `POST $SB_DEMO_APP_URL/api/public/n8n/demo/reset` (x-api-key) → buat akun demo bila belum ada, hapus permanen data akun demo, isi ulang data contoh.\n\n**Env:** `SB_DEMO_APP_URL` (tanpa `/` di akhir). **Credential:** Header Auth \"Second Brain Demo API\" (`x-api-key` = `N8N_API_KEY` project **demo**, bukan produksi).\nLangkah lengkap: `docs/DEMO.md`.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 620,
        "color": "6"
      },
      "id": "9a0d4c4e-2f61-4b8e-9d1a-5c1e0b7f9001",
      "name": "Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-60, -400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "triggerAtHour": 0
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "9a0d4c4e-2f61-4b8e-9d1a-5c1e0b7f9002",
      "name": "Tiap hari 00:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [0, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.SB_DEMO_APP_URL }}/api/public/n8n/demo/reset",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        },
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({}) }}"
      },
      "id": "9a0d4c4e-2f61-4b8e-9d1a-5c1e0b7f9003",
      "name": "Reset demo",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [240, 0],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ME",
          "name": "Second Brain Demo API"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
